# Known Remote GPU Boxes

Remote GPU boxes in use. SSH form:
`ssh -o ConnectTimeout=25 -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null macui@<HOST> '<cmd>'`
Container exec: `docker exec <CONTAINER> bash -lc "..."`. Always export
`PYTHONPATH=/sgl-workspace/squidward/python:${PYTHONPATH}` for python; the fork lives at
`/sgl-workspace/squidward`.

**Container name does NOT imply workstream — always verify the running container, its
branch, and its live server before acting; do not assume `dsv4`.** A box can host
several containers on different branches.

## quanta box — gfx942 / CDNA3 (MI300X/MI325X, mi30x)
- Host: `quanta-ccs-aus-f11-40.cs-aus.dcgpu`
- Container `dsv4`, image `rocm/sgl-dev:...-rocm720-mi30x-...`
- This is the fp8 **e4m3fnuz** box (the gfx942 fp8 fixes target this arch).

## gbt box — gfx950 / CDNA4 (MI350X/MI355X, mi35x)  ← A GLM-5.2 BOX
- Host: `gbt350-odcdh2-b13-1.png-odc.dcgpu`
- **GLM-5.2 work runs in the `glm5` container** (NOT `dsv4`): fork on branch
  `RM/glm51`, image `rocm/sgl-dev:v0.5.14-rocm720-mi35x-20260706`, GLM-5.2-MXFP4
  server on port 8552 (`docker exec glm5 bash -lc "..."`).
- Container config: `/dev/kfd`+`/dev/dri`, `--ipc=host --shm-size=64g --network=host`,
  `--cap-add SYS_PTRACE`, `--group-add video render`, `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined
  --security-opt label=disable`, `-v /home/macui/hf_home:/root/hf_home`,
  `-v /home/macui/spongebob:/sgl-workspace/squidward`, `-e HF_HOME=/root/hf_home`.
- This is the fp8 **e4m3fn** box (gfx950). Our gfx942 fixes are arch-gated, so gfx950 is unaffected.

## smci355 box — gfx950 / CDNA4 (MI355X, mi35x)  ← A GLM-5.2 BOX
- Host: `smci355-ccs-aus-n06-05.cs-aus.dcgpu`
- **GLM-5.2 work runs in the `glm5` container**: fork on branch `RM/glm51`, image
  `rocm/sgl-dev:v0.5.14-rocm720-mi35x-20260706`, server on port 8552.
- Container config mirrors the gbt `glm5` box (same devices/ipc/shm/net/caps/groups/
  secopt/env), but host source paths differ:
  `-v /mnt/dcgpuval/huggingface:/root/hf_home` (GLM-5.2-MXFP4 model lives on the shared
  NFS `/mnt/dcgpuval`, ~410G, snapshot `386bd0e4ec821f7b07975701cec3c3b953a5576a`; no
  local download) and `-v /home/macui/squidward:/sgl-workspace/squidward`.
- SHARED, MULTI-TENANT box: many other users' containers run here (`torch_*`, `verl`,
  `xiangxli_dev`, etc.) and grab GPUs; the root fs runs near-full (98%), so images/clones
  must be sized carefully. Do NOT disturb other tenants' containers.
- fp8 **e4m3fn** (gfx950).

Follow `remote-box-rules.mdc` for all box-safety constraints (no upstream edits, no pip install,
box never ahead of local, no git-state changes without explicit instruction, etc.).
